ideo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213230/extras/f3e10134bf6c8781a0cef10adceaf426.poster.avif?t=1726253271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213230/extras/f3e10134bf6c8781a0cef10adceaf426.webm?t=1726253271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213230/extras/f3e10134bf6c8781a0cef10adceaf426.mp4?t=1726253271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213230/extras/24cd71a78c6ad18a15776a93ef399623.poster.avif?t=1726253271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213230/extras/24cd71a78c6ad18a15776a93ef399623.webm?t=1726253271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213230/extras/24cd71a78c6ad18a15776a93ef399623.mp4?t=1726253271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>If you're a fan of <i>Untitled Goose Game</i> or <i>Donut County</i>, this will be right up your alley!</strong>",
